# Long trail segments: do they stay straight? Also shows the taller walls.
wait 15.5
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
# Speed 20 (1200 units/s), 3 s north, then west for 3 s: legs about 3600 long
press c 13
wait 3
press left
wait 3
shot trails_1_iso
press right
wait 2
shot trails_2_iso_after_turn
# 1st person, looking along the trail behind? Turn back on ourselves to look down the legs
press down
wait 0.3
shot trails_3_1st
press right
wait 1.5
shot trails_4_1st_turned
# X: full-length serpentine across the arena (rows about 15600 long)
press x
wait 0.5
shot trails_5_1st_serpentine
press down
wait 0.3
shot trails_6_iso_serpentine
